      "Why do you want this People Development Consultant role now?": ["Work direction is shifting | From specific tasks | To systems that sustain growth", "Build learning systems | Develop skills and confidence | Turn chaos into order", "Onboard new hires | Lead Learning Studio | Support team engagement", "Broader than training | Talent development solutions | Growth after programs"],
